WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.194
Here is a QR code that will still work

2
00:00:02.264 --> 00:00:05.120
in ten years. Start with a website address

3
00:00:05.201 --> 00:00:07.953
— type it and the code redraws instantly,

4
00:00:08.197 --> 00:00:10.124
no generate button, no waiting.

5
00:00:10.565 --> 00:00:12.527
What matters is what is inside it.

6
00:00:12.968 --> 00:00:15.232
Most free generators hide a tracking link on

7
00:00:15.267 --> 00:00:16.439
their own domain in there,

8
00:00:16.521 --> 00:00:18.773
which is exactly why printed codes go dead

9
00:00:18.819 --> 00:00:21.815
when a plan lapses. This one encodes your address

10
00:00:21.861 --> 00:00:24.241
directly, so there is nothing to expire.

11
00:00:24.752 --> 00:00:27.167
Switch to WiFi and it works the same way.

12
00:00:27.608 --> 00:00:28.839
Type the network name,

13
00:00:28.966 --> 00:00:30.929
type the password, and the pattern changes

14
00:00:30.987 --> 00:00:33.460
as you go — your guests point a camera

15
00:00:33.518 --> 00:00:36.757
and join, no typing. That password is encoded

16
00:00:36.826 --> 00:00:39.090
right here in your browser and never uploaded.

17
00:00:39.415 --> 00:00:40.867
Change the colours if you like;

18
00:00:41.111 --> 00:00:43.084
you get a warning the moment the contrast drops

19
00:00:43.131 --> 00:00:44.721
too low to scan reliably.

20
00:00:44.965 --> 00:00:47.275
Then download it. PNG for screens,

21
00:00:47.392 --> 00:00:49.806
SVG for print. No account,

22
00:00:49.923 --> 00:00:51.827
no email, no expiry.
